Section 3.
Section twenty-three hundred and seven of Act Numbered Twenty-seven hundred and eleven, and all acts or parts of acts inconsistent with the provisions of this Act are hereby repealed.
Section 4.
This Act shall take effect on January first, nineteen hundred and twenty-eight.
Approved, December 8, 1927.
